remstart
    QUESTS
    from the third round on, every round has one quest: a little job on the board that is nothing to
    do with filling the bar. finishing it pays out every point that the round still needs, so a
    quest that is finished wins the round, however far the round had to go. the routines are in
    fish_routines_quests, and
    the list of quests, with what each one asks for, is at the top of that file.

    a quest is always something that the player can leave alone. most of them only put something
    on the board to be done, or not. the few that change how the game plays do nothing until the
    player starts them. the pickup sits just off of the right edge of the board, where the cursor
    cannot come to it by accident. see QUEST_STATE, and THE CURSOR STEPS OFF OF THE BOARD.

    when a quest fails, it starts over: whatever it put on the board is cleaned away, and it is set
    up afresh. a quest is not lost when the round ends. it carries on into the next round, and the
    one after, until it is finished, and only then does a round bring a new one. so there is one
    quest at a time, and at most one is finished in a round.

    WHAT A QUEST HAS TO WORK WITH
    - a mark on a fish. it goes wherever the fish goes, the same as a stack does, and it is gone
      when the fish pops. QUEST_MARK holds them. swapCellStacks, in fish_funcs, takes them along.
    - a spot on a cell, which stays put, whatever fish comes and goes. QUEST_SPOT holds them.
    - five kinds of fish of its own. see THE QUEST KINDS.
    - the numbers in QUEST_V, and the list in QUEST_LIST, to keep whatever else it needs.

    WHAT A QUEST HEARS ABOUT. questEvent, in fish_routines_quests, passes these on to the quest:
    - QEV_INIT     it is being set up, on a board that has settled
    - QEV_START    the cursor stepped onto its pickup
    - QEV_SWAP     a swap finished. the two fish have traded places already.
    - QEV_STEP     the cursor came to a new cell, with a swap or without one
    - QEV_JUDGE    handle_combos has looked at the board, and fish are popping
    - QEV_SETTLE   handle_combos has looked at the board, and nothing pops. this is the only time
                   that a quest changes the fish on the board, because nothing else is moving them.
    - QEV_DRAW     once a frame, to draw itself
remend

