` THE QUEST KINDS. five kinds of fish that only a quest puts on the board. load_textures, in
` fish_routines, loads their pictures right after the bottle, so that they are fish 11 to 15: a fish
` is saved as its number, and the arrays that go by kind have room for 16.
` krill is a kind like any other, and three of it pop. the rest never match anything, not even each
` other. findCombos, in fish_funcs, leaves them out. a quest that ends takes its own off of the board.
